{
  "_comment": [
    "The single source of truth for how one scoreboard cell reads, consumed by",
    "both language's test suites so the three surfaces cannot drift apart.",
    "",
    "tests/animator/js/cell-format.test.cjs drives animator/static/js/cell-format.js",
    "with these cells; tests/web/test_scoreboard_route.py builds the equivalent",
    "ProblemResult and renders web/template/contest/scoreboard.html. Web is",
    "server-rendered Jinja and cannot import the JavaScript formatter, so it is a",
    "third rendering of the same wording -- this file is what pins the three",
    "together. Adding a case here makes both suites answer for it.",
    "",
    "`attempts` is already the count of failures BEFORE the accepted submission",
    "(see ProblemResult.attempts in shared/services/scoreboard_projection.py), so a",
    "solved cell reports `+attempts` directly. Subtracting one underreports every",
    "solve.",
    "",
    "`minute` is the cell's first line for a solve. `attempt_line` is the attempts",
    "and the penalty they caused, as ONE line -- never split across two, which is",
    "what made the projector's pending cell the tallest on any surface. An empty",
    "string means the cell has no such line."
  ],
  "cases": [
    {
      "name": "solved on the first attempt",
      "cell": {
        "solved": true,
        "attempts": 0,
        "penalty": 0,
        "solved_at_minutes": 15,
        "is_pending": false,
        "is_first_balloon": false
      },
      "state": "solved",
      "minute": "15'",
      "attempt_line": "",
      "web_cell_class": "noca-problem-cell--solved"
    },
    {
      "name": "solved after failures",
      "cell": {
        "solved": true,
        "attempts": 2,
        "penalty": 40,
        "solved_at_minutes": 34,
        "is_pending": false,
        "is_first_balloon": false
      },
      "state": "solved",
      "minute": "34'",
      "attempt_line": "+2 (40')",
      "web_cell_class": "noca-problem-cell--solved"
    },
    {
      "name": "first to solve",
      "cell": {
        "solved": true,
        "attempts": 0,
        "penalty": 0,
        "solved_at_minutes": 12,
        "is_pending": false,
        "is_first_balloon": true
      },
      "state": "solved",
      "minute": "12'",
      "attempt_line": "",
      "web_cell_class": "noca-problem-cell--first"
    },
    {
